              Terminate immediately on any step failure
            </label>
            <small style="color: #999; display: block; font-size: 11px; white-space: pre-wrap;">When checked, the orchestration stops as soon as any step returns a non-zero exit code.
When unchecked (default), execution continues through the graph to a Success or Failure end node.</small>
          </div>

